msgid "This prompt acts as a dictionary for the highlighted text, to a word or phrase."
msgstr "Bu prompt ajratilgan matn uchun, yaʼni soʻz yoki ibora uchun lugʻat vazifasini bajaradi."

msgid "This prompt analyzes the grammar of the highlighted text, providing a detailed explanation of its structure and any grammatical errors."
msgstr "Bu prompt ajratilgan matnning grammatikasini tahlil qiladi, uning tuzilishi va har qanday grammatik xatolar haqida batafsil tushuntirish beradi."

msgid "This prompt analyzes the vocabulary of the highlighted text, identifying complex words and providing definitions, synonyms, and usage examples."
msgstr "Bu prompt ajratilgan matnning soʻz boyligini tahlil qiladi, murakkab soʻzlarni aniqlaydi hamda ularning taʼriflari, sinonimlari va qoʻllanish misollarini beradi."

msgid "This prompt creates a structured system for generating context-aware definitions of words or phrases from literature by analyzing the highlighted term within its surrounding text to provide nuanced explanations that capture both literal meaning and contextual significance."
msgstr "Bu prompt adabiyotdagi soʻz yoki iboralarning kontekstga mos taʼriflarini yaratish uchun tizimli tuzilma yaratadi: ajratilgan atamani uning atrofidagi matn ichida tahlil qilib, ham lugʻaviy maʼnoni, ham kontekstual ahamiyatni qamrab oluvchi nozik tushuntirishlar beradi."

msgid "This prompt explains the highlighted text as if to a five-year-old, simplifying complex concepts into easily understandable terms."
msgstr "Bu prompt ajratilgan matnni besh yoshli bolaga tushuntirgandek, murakkab tushunchalarni oson tushunarli soʻzlar bilan soddalashtirib beradi."

msgid "This prompt explains the highlighted text in detail, ensuring clarity and understanding."
msgstr "Bu prompt ajratilgan matnni batafsil tushuntiradi, aniqlik va tushunishni taʼminlaydi."

msgid "This prompt extracts and lists the key points from the highlighted text, ensuring clarity and organization."
msgstr "Bu prompt ajratilgan matndan asosiy fikrlarni ajratib oladi va roʻyxatini tuzadi, aniqlik va tartibni taʼminlaydi."

msgid "This prompt generates a comprehensive Wikipedia-style article based on the highlighted text, ensuring factual accuracy and neutrality."
msgstr "Bu prompt ajratilgan matn asosida keng qamrovli, Vikipediya uslubidagi maqola yaratadi, faktik aniqlik va betaraflikni taʼminlaydi."

msgid "This prompt provides a detailed historical context for the highlighted text, explaining its significance and background."
msgstr "Bu prompt ajratilgan matn uchun batafsil tarixiy kontekst beradi, uning ahamiyati va kelib chiqishini tushuntiradi."

msgid "This prompt simplifies the highlighted text to make it easier to understand."
msgstr "Bu prompt ajratilgan matnni tushunish osonroq boʻlishi uchun soddalashtiradi."

msgid "This prompt summarizes the highlighted text, capturing its main points and essential details."
msgstr "Bu prompt ajratilgan matnni xulosalaydi, uning asosiy fikrlari va muhim tafsilotlarini qamrab oladi."

msgid "This prompt translates the highlighted text to another language."
msgstr "Bu prompt ajratilgan matnni boshqa tilga tarjima qiladi."

